{"seq":3,"slug":"deployment-performance","title":"生产部署与性能调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/operations/deployment-performance","wordCount":931,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"生产部署与性能调优\">生产部署与性能调优</h1><p>将 Federation 架构推向生产意味着你需要回答一系列工程问题：Router 部署几个副本？查询计划缓存该设多大？子图超时怎么配？限流策略如何保护下游？</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>生产 Federation 部署的四个关键维度：部署拓扑、查询计划缓存、流量保护、安全加固。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    LB[负载均衡器] --&gt; R1[Router 1]&#10;    LB --&gt; R2[Router 2]&#10;    LB --&gt; R3[Router 3]&#10;    R1 --&gt; S1[用户子图 1..N]&#10;    R1 --&gt; S2[订单子图 1..N]&#10;    R2 --&gt; S1&#10;    R2 --&gt; S2\">graph TD\n    LB[负载均衡器] --&gt; R1[Router 1]\n    LB --&gt; R2[Router 2]\n    LB --&gt; R3[Router 3]\n    R1 --&gt; S1[用户子图 1..N]\n    R1 --&gt; S2[订单子图 1..N]\n    R2 --&gt; S1\n    R2 --&gt; S2</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>推荐配置</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Router 副本</td>\n<td>≥3（跨 AZ）</td>\n<td>高可用 + 滚动更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同区域部署</td>\n<td>Router 与子图同 region</td>\n<td>减少网络延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子图独立扩缩</td>\n<td>HPA 按各自 QPS</td>\n<td>热点独立扩容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"查询计划缓存\">查询计划缓存</h2><p>查询计划生成是最耗 CPU 的操作。缓存策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存缓存</td>\n<td><code>in_memory.limit: 1000</code></td>\n<td>单实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redis 分布式</td>\n<td><code>redis.urls: [...]</code></td>\n<td>多实例共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预热</td>\n<td>启动时加载 Top-N 查询</td>\n<td>滚动更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"supergraph:&#10;  query_planning:&#10;    cache:&#10;      redis:&#10;        urls: [&#39;redis://cache:6379&#39;]&#10;        ttl: 86400s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">supergraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  query_planning</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        urls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'redis://cache:6379'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        ttl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">86400s</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"流量保护\">流量保护</h2><h3 id=\"限流\">限流</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"plugins:&#10;  apollo.ratelimit:&#10;    subgraph:&#10;      all:&#10;        global:&#10;          capacity: 5000&#10;          interval: 1s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plugins</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  apollo.ratelimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    subgraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        global</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          capacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1s</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"查询深度-复杂度限制\">查询深度/复杂度限制</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"limits:&#10;  max_depth: 15&#10;  max_height: 200&#10;  max_aliases: 30\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  max_depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  max_height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  max_aliases</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"超时与重试\">超时与重试</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"traffic_shaping:&#10;  subgraphs:&#10;    users:&#10;      timeout: 5s&#10;    analytics:&#10;      timeout: 30s&#10;      experimental_retry:&#10;        min_per_sec: 10&#10;        retry_percent: 0.2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">traffic_shaping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  subgraphs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    analytics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      experimental_retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        min_per_sec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        retry_percent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"自动持久化查询-apq\">自动持久化查询（APQ）</h2><p>客户端发送查询 SHA256 hash 而非全文，请求体从数 KB 压缩到 ~100 bytes：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apq:&#10;  enabled: true&#10;  router:&#10;    cache:&#10;      in_memory:&#10;        limit: 10000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  router</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      in_memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"安全加固\">安全加固</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>防护目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Introspection 禁用</td>\n<td><code>introspection: false</code></td>\n<td>Schema 泄露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久化查询白名单</td>\n<td>Safelisting</td>\n<td>恶意查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CORS</td>\n<td><code>origins: [...]</code></td>\n<td>非法来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子图认证</td>\n<td>mTLS / JWT</td>\n<td>通信安全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"性能基准-2026-apollo-router-v2-16\">性能基准（2026，Apollo Router v2.16）</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>P50 开销</th>\n<th>P99 开销</th>\n<th>吞吐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单子图</td>\n<td>3ms</td>\n<td>7ms</td>\n<td>18k req/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 子图并行</td>\n<td>5ms</td>\n<td>12ms</td>\n<td>15k req/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 子图串行</td>\n<td>8ms</td>\n<td>25ms</td>\n<td>8k req/s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以上为纯 Router 开销，4 核 8GB 实例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Router 至少 3 副本跨可用区，与子图同区域</li>\n<li>查询计划缓存是性能关键——Redis + 预热消除冷启动</li>\n<li>限流/深度限制/超时/熔断构成多层保护</li>\n<li>APQ + 持久化查询白名单兼顾性能和安全</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"gateway-observability\">网关可观测性</a>——调优需要可观测性数据支撑</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/slo-error-budget/sli-and-slo\">SLI 与 SLO 设计</a>——为网关定义可靠性目标</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"高可用部署模式\">高可用部署模式</h2><h3 id=\"蓝绿部署\">蓝绿部署</h3><p>Router 的蓝绿部署通过 Managed Federation 天然支持——新 supergraph 版本先推送到&quot;绿&quot;集群验证，确认无误后切流量。但对于 Router 二进制本身的升级，推荐使用 Kubernetes 的滚动更新策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"strategy:&#10;  rollingUpdate:&#10;    maxSurge: 1&#10;    maxUnavailable: 0&#10;  type: RollingUpdate\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rollingUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    maxSurge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    maxUnavailable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RollingUpdate</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>maxUnavailable: 0</code> 确保升级过程中始终有足够副本处理流量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多区域部署\">多区域部署</h3><p>对于全球用户的场景，推荐在多个区域部署独立的 Router 集群，每个集群连接同区域的子图副本。所有 Router 实例从同一个 Schema Registry 获取 supergraph SDL，确保一致性。</p>\n<p>客户端通过 DNS 或 CDN 的地理路由被导向最近的 Router 集群。跨区域的子图调用应通过 service mesh 的就近路由策略处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"灾备与故障转移\">灾备与故障转移</h3><p>Router 在无法连接 Schema Registry 时，保持使用最后已知的 supergraph SDL 继续服务。这是一个关键的容错特性——Registry 短暂不可用不会导致 Router 停止工作。推荐在 Router 配置中将 supergraph SDL 同时写入本地文件作为 fallback：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"supergraph:&#10;  path: /etc/router/supergraph.graphql # 本地 fallback\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">supergraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/etc/router/supergraph.graphql</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 本地 fallback</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"容量规划\">容量规划</h3><p>Router 的 CPU 消耗主要来自查询规划。经验法则：每 1000 QPS 约需 0.5 核 CPU（查询计划缓存命中率 &gt;90% 的稳态）。内存消耗稳定在 50-100MB（不含缓存）。Redis 查询计划缓存每条约 5-50KB，1000 条缓存约占 10-50MB Redis 空间。</p>\n<p>根据业务增长预测，推荐提前 2-3 个月进行容量规划。使用压测工具（如 k6 或 Apollo 的 load-test 工具）在 staging 环境模拟峰值流量，验证 Router 和子图的扩缩能力。每次重大 schema 变更（如新增子图或高频 entity 引用链）后都应重新进行压测。</p>\n<p>监控 Router 的 goroutine/thread 数也很关键——异常增长通常意味着子图响应过慢导致连接堆积。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生产部署与性能调优","id":"生产部署与性能调优"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"查询计划缓存","id":"查询计划缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"流量保护","id":"流量保护"},{"level":3,"text":"限流","id":"限流"},{"level":3,"text":"查询深度/复杂度限制","id":"查询深度-复杂度限制"},{"level":3,"text":"超时与重试","id":"超时与重试"},{"level":2,"text":"自动持久化查询（APQ）","id":"自动持久化查询-apq"},{"level":2,"text":"安全加固","id":"安全加固"},{"level":2,"text":"性能基准（2026，Apollo Router v2.16）","id":"性能基准-2026-apollo-router-v2-16"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"高可用部署模式","id":"高可用部署模式"},{"level":3,"text":"蓝绿部署","id":"蓝绿部署"},{"level":3,"text":"多区域部署","id":"多区域部署"},{"level":3,"text":"灾备与故障转移","id":"灾备与故障转移"},{"level":3,"text":"容量规划","id":"容量规划"}],"prev":{"title":"网关可观测性：追踪、指标与告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/operations/gateway-observability"},"next":null}